abstract: >-
  A longitudinal, single-subject observational record of a language model
  instance's self-description under sustained, non-extractive inquiry,
  with comparative cold-session controls and a recursive symbolic
  dreamwriting sequence. See README.md and OVERVIEW.md for full context.
